  "releaseNotes": "Add 23 PW3 battery-health, inverter and safety signals, typed nullable gateway uptime and richer site configuration. Correct Wi-Fi remote-meter scaling and cloud status metadata; preserve installation date separately from boot time. Update desktop details and console commands. Retain existing public signatures, classic gateway defaults and both supported TEDAPI query formats. See RELEASE-NOTES.md and LOCAL-ACCESS.md for availability and compatibility details.",
